  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Huutopussi (Finnish partnership trick-taking). 4 players, 2 partnerships, 52-card deck. Deal: 13 cards per player. Bidding: Partnerships bid total points. Exchange: 3 cards with partner. Play: 13 tricks, follow suit, must overplay (play higher if able). Marriage: King-Queen same suit sets trump, awards points (Spades 40, Clubs 60, Diamonds 80, Hearts 100). Scoring: Ace(11) 10(10) K(4) Q(3) J(2), last trick +20. Win: First to 500.',
    Player: 'Welcome to Huutopussi, the pinnacle of Finnish card games. Your partnership bids to capture points. If you win the bid, exchange 3 cards with your partner. Then play all 13 tricksâ€”follow suit and remember the overplay rule: if you can play higher, you must. Declare marriages to set trump and earn marriage bonuses. First partnership to 500 points wins.',
    objective: 'Be the first partnership to reach 500 points. Points are earned by winning tricks and declaring marriages.',
    gameplay: "1. Must follow suit. Must overplay (Ylimenopakko): if you can play a higher card than the current winner of the trick, you MUST. 2. Trump: There is no trump until a player who won the previous trick leads a King or Queen and declares a 'Marriage' of that suit. 3. Marriage Values: Spades (40), Clubs (60), Diamonds (80), Hearts (100). Declaring a marriage sets that suit as Trump.",
    keyRules: [
      'Must follow suit',
      'Must overplay (play higher if able)',
      'Marriage declares trump: Spades 40, Clubs 60, Diamonds 80, Hearts 100',
      'First to 500 points wins',
    ],
